This is the source material for the textbook *Theory of Computing*
by Jim Hefferon.   Get a PDF at https://hefferon.net/computation.

This source uses LaTeX and related programs.  To install the source
files, see INSTALL.


STATUS

This is a draft.  I used it for a class in the springs of 2018--2020,
and am using it in the spring of 2021.

Next is to supplement the text with Jupyter notebooks, to illustrate
things like Turing machines and regular expressions with code.
I use Racket.  I am now writing these.


REPORTS

As with any draft, or any large software project for that matter, expect
errors.  Bug reports are very welcome.  Reach me is via the Contact
link at https://hefferon.net


HOME PAGE

https://hefferon.net/computation


